{"hashes":[3753500813,4105572261],"detail":{"item":{"hash":4105572261,"name":"Prime Zealot Gloves","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/c0ef7b4f342a19611f0c34e74db91dbf.jpg","typeName":"Gauntlets","exotic":false,"bucket":3551918588},"sets":[{"name":"Atheon's Memory","pieces":1,"perks":[{"required":2,"name":"Radiolaria Breach","description":"After picking up an Orb of Power, the next time your shields are broken, gain a bonus to Health stat for a short duration and release a burst of radiolaria around you.","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/0a0c002d2eb7c7687fe93c02143d9c23.png","active":false,"exact":"On Orb of Power Pickup:\nGrants Radiolaria Breach.\nCan only trigger once per Full Heal.\n\nUpon reaching Critical Health:\nConsumes Radiolaria Breach to trigger an explosion that deals up to 360 [11] Damage over 7 meters.\n+50 Health Stat for 7.5 seconds and releases 4 Radiolaria Pools 5 meters away from the user.\nRadiolaria Pools deal 14 Arc Damage every 0.5 seconds."},{"required":4,"name":"Collective Power","description":"While you have a subclass buff, dealing sustained damage creates an Orb of Power.","icon":"/common/destiny2_content/icons/19fd2268026b9e381de699a3dc941741.png","active":false,"exact":"Upon scoring 5 damage instances while any Elemental Buff is active:\nSpawns an Orb of Power on the user that grants 0.8?% Super Energy.\nIncurs a 1 second cooldown upon spawning an Orb where additional damage instances will not count.\nOnly counts a hit up to once every 0.8s, meaning the perk takes AT LEAST 4 seconds to trigger. \nConsecutive triggers take a minimum of 5 seconds to reproc.\n\nDamage Instances dealt to Immune Enemies count towards spawning Orbs.\n\nElemental Buffs:\nAmplified, Bolt Charge | Cure, Radiant, Restoration | Devour, Invisibility, Overshield\nFrost Armor | Woven Mail\nAnd also standing in a Healing Rift for no reason"}]}],"fromCopy":false,"versions":[3753500813,4105572261]},"copies":[{"instanceId":"6917530203610042385","itemHash":41055